  "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nI just installed my synapse server and everything seems to work fine. I even tested federation on https://federationtester.matrix.org/ and it works, but when I try to register a new user with `register_new_matrix_user -c homeserver.yaml http://localhost:8008` I got:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSending registration request...\r\nERROR! Received 400 Bad Request\r\nShared secret registration is not enabled\r\n```\r\nI checked my homeserver.yaml and I can see this line: `registration_shared_secret: \"[my secret]\"`. I've tried with and without quotes but got the same response.\r\n\r\nI also changed `enable_registration: true` without success.\r\n\r\nAm I missing something? Thank you.",
